sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Visitor
  participant JS as chatbot.js
  participant CF as Cloudflare
  participant CA as Caddy
  participant WP as WordPress plugin
  U->>JS: types a question, Send
  JS->>CF: POST /wp-json/uno-chat/v1/ask<br/>{question, session_id} + X-WP-Nonce
  CF->>CA: forward over HTTPS<br/>CF-Connecting-IP = visitor IP
  CA->>CA: per-IP limits<br/>300/min site, 20/min chat API
  CA->>WP: proxy, X-Real-IP = visitor IP
  WP->>WP: nonce check<br/>10 questions/hour per IP<br/>300 questions/day site-wide
  Note over WP: continues in the backend<br/>sequence (next diagram)
  WP-->>CA: {answer, sources, trace_id}
  CA-->>CF: response
  CF-->>JS: response
  JS-->>U: answer, source chips,<br/>thumbs up/down
